+/// GNX-PROP: reads a prop's "react" block (arg0) into one struct; arg1 = who (for mod errors), arg2 = the
+/// frames of the prop's sprite. The prop listens to the cell on one side of its passage:
+///   side    "left", "right", "both" (default) or "facing" (right, left while the prop is mirrored;
+///           draw the PNG facing right)
